[l_english.EQUIPMENT_SHIELD_RIOT_POLICE]
Riot Police Equipments (Heavy Armor)

[l_english.EQUIPMENT_SHIELD_RIOT_POLICE_desc]
A third-class weapon user fires at one’s enemies, a second-class weapon user fires at one’s subjects, and a first-class weapon user does not need to fire at all because the subjects can manage to fire at themselves.
§g“Pony world does not have ‘brutal suppresion’ but only ‘assertive friendship enforcement’!”§!

[l_english.EQUIPMENT_SHIELD_RIOT_POLICE_short]
Riot Police Equipments

[l_simp_chinese.EQUIPMENT_SHIELD_RIOT_POLICE]
防暴装备 (重甲装备)

[l_simp_chinese.EQUIPMENT_SHIELD_RIOT_POLICE_desc]
三流的武器使用者向敌人开火，二流的武器使用者向臣民开火，一流的武器使用者根本不需要开火，因为臣民们会互相开火。
§g“小马世界没有‘残暴镇压’，只有‘友谊的坚定强制执行’！”§!

[l_simp_chinese.EQUIPMENT_SHIELD_RIOT_POLICE_short]
防暴装备
